  "description": [
    "A single black rose is affixed to the end of the trellises here, almost invisible against the dark emerald foliage surrounding it.  The rotting carcass of a strange four-legged beast lies to one side of the trail, large chunks of its flesh, to include its head, completely missing.  The buzzing of flies fills the air, as small clouds of the things feast on the still-glistening innards of the creature."
